# Lines 14-15 Power(X,2) -> Sqr, 16 Power(X,0.5) -> Sqrt, 17 Sqrt(Sqr+Sqr) ->
# Hypot must fire. Lines 18-22 must not (other exponent, plain Sqrt, minus,
# one Sqr, Hypot already used).
# Known FP shape: Power(X, 2) on Extended/Single where the Sqr overload
# differs in precision; negative X with Power(X, 0.5) (NaN vs EInvalidOp).
suboptimal-math 14
suboptimal-math 15
suboptimal-math 16
suboptimal-math 17
!suboptimal-math 18
!suboptimal-math 19
!suboptimal-math 20
!suboptimal-math 21
!suboptimal-math 22
